  m_Name: ZeroWayMirror
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DisplayName: Zero-Way Mirror
  Description: 'A foggy mountainside, penumbra falls over the scenery as you stare
    at the meters-high mirror. A perfect representation of what''s behind you: the
    leaves swaying in the breeze, the birds flying off in the distance... but no you.
    You do not appear in the reflection. Everything is here, but you.

    A mission based on visuals and observation.'
